        "original_id": "800f5d5f-cd58-5d53-b4ce-45986f46b9a4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Jane the Virgin (season 1), Filly Brown, The Bold and the Beautiful, Deepwater Horizon\n- People: Gina Rodriguez, Justin Baldoni\n- Characters: Jane Villanueva, Rafael Solano, Majo Tenorio, Beverly, Andrea Fleytas\n- Topics: episode count, casting, plot premise\n\nFacts:\n- Jane the Virgin season 1 consisted of 22 episodes.\n- In Jane the Virgin season 1, Gina Rodriguez starred as Jane Villanueva, a young Latina university student who is accidentally artificially inseminated with Rafael Solano's sperm.\n- In Jane the Virgin season 1, Justin Baldoni portrayed Rafael Solano, who is Jane Villanueva's boss.\n- Gina Rodriguez portrayed Majo Tenorio in the musical-drama film Filly Brown.\n- Gina Rodriguez portrayed Beverly in the soap opera The Bold and the Beautiful.\n- Gina Rodriguez portrayed Andrea Fleytas in Deepwater Horizon.",
